-### f-iter004-002 [P1] — decision-record.md and goal.md headers ship Oxford commas
-- THE CLAIM (rule side): `hvr-rules.md` Section 3 — "**Oxford Comma Ban** | , and | NEVER use | Drop the comma before 'and'/'or'".
