-- `lib/validation/orchestrator.ts`'s `REGISTRY_SHELL_RULE_WRAPPER` and `resolveRegistryRuleScript`, which resolve every `rules/*.sh` `script_path` value. New files must resolve the same way existing ones do.
-
-**Deliverables**:
