-# Decision Record: Criteria file-line enforcement
-
-<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: decision-record | v2.2 -->
-<!-- HVR_REFERENCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-with-human-voice/references/hvr-rules.md -->
